        },
        "description": "Aki has an unfussy and motherly temper while also known to have a caring nature too. She's also a very talented artist. She is a second-year student in [Kyouya Hashiba](https://anilist.co/character/197117/Hashiba-Kyouya)'s Department of Film who is commonly known as \"Shinoaki\".\n\n~!As of 2016, she was working as a famous illustrator under the name Shino Akishima, whom Kyouya adored.!~\n\n~!In the world of 2018, she married Kyouya (which makes her Aki Hashiba) and become a mother of one child named [Maki Hashiba](https://anilist.co/character/239482/Hashiba-Maki), but had to quit to being a painter as she had lost interest in art. After some time, she quickly found the passion to draw again.!~",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "28 (18)"
      },
