        },
        "description": "Main protagonist of the series. He travels back ten years ago by an unknown event. Kyouya shows a very calm personality. He is inspired by a group of talented people known as \"The Platinum Generation\".\n\n~!Kyouya had been deeply inspired by paintings of a famous female illustrator which made him feel alive when he was working as a game developer, later Kyouya found out that Aki Shino was indeed that famous illustrator named Shino Akishima.!~\n\n~!In the world of 2018 he married Aki Shino (which makes her Aki Hashiba) and he was the father of a child with a daughter, Maki Hashiba.!~",
